is examined characteristics (including age, underlying medical conditions, and clinical outcomes) of 3,218 adults\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sampled data are presented as unweighted case counts and weighted percentages\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"weighted for the probability of selection and adjusted to better represent the hospitalized population of the catchment area\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Age distributions of patients aged ≥60 years who were hospitalized and experienced severe outcomes were compared with the overall age distribution of persons ≥60 years in the RSV-NET catchment area.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences were assessed using chi-square tests; p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}